 1│  ┌─╭─ Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮    │
 2│  │ │ Scrolling                                                            │    │
 3│  │ │  0-9                 count for the next command (5j, 50%, 120g)      │    │
 4│  │ │  j ↓ ^E ^N           down a line                                     │    │
 5│  └─│  k ↑ ^Y ^P           up a line                                       │    │
 6│    │  Space f PgDn ^F     down a page                                     │    │
 7│   K│  b PgUp ^B           up a page                                       │    │
 8│    │  d ^D                down half a page                                │    │
 9│  A │  u ^U                up half a page                                  │    │
10│  li│  g Home <            top (line N with a count)                       │t-  │
11│  la│  G End >             bottom (line N with a count)                    │    │
12│  an│  %                   N percent into the document                     │    │
13│  th│                                                                      │    │
14│    │ Jumping                                                              │    │
15│  He│  ]                   next heading                                    │    │
16│  ━━│  [                   previous heading                                │──  │
17│    │  }                   next heading of the same or a higher level      │    │
18│  ▎ │  {                   previous heading of the same or a higher level  │    │
19│    │  t                   outline (type to filter)                        │    │
20│  Fo│                                                                      │    │
21│    │ Searching                                                            │    │
22│  Fi│  /                   search forward                                  │    │
